Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='rootsrefresh', at=datetime(2026, 9, 21, 0, 0, 0), actor='assistant', title="The roots refresh when the user repository's lock moves; roots/app moves last", body="*The roots refresh when the lock moves* (`suzatary-roots.path`, 2026-09-21, `docs/LAZYBUILDSTALL-PLAN-2026-09-21.md`; the lock since 2026-10-04): a user path unit on the user repository's `flake.lock` runs the one reader of the lock (`nix/services.nix` `roots`, over `nix/app-input.nix`) at `Nice=10`. It reads only a COMMITTED lock, builds only a revision a deploy pinned on the branch the box follows or the pin before it, a revert's way back (`scripts/followed.sh admit`), roots the tree before building it, refuses a tree without `nix/app-input.nix`, builds the binary, the bundle, the plugins and the `.#triage` shell (a profile) under names only it moves, and moves `roots/app` last, so a failed run leaves every unit on the app it ran and a unit's start builds nothing. `nix/module-check.nix` evaluates the module and pins these facts, the run's order included.", rationale="Decided 2026-09-21 (docs/LAZYBUILDSTALL-PLAN-2026-09-21.md); on the user repository's lock since 2026-10-04.", supersedes=()))